# Copy to .env (shared defaults) or .env.local (this machine only). Development builds
# (`cargo tauri dev`, `cargo run`) read both at start; variables already set in your shell
# win, and .env.local wins over .env. Release builds never read them and never bundle them.
# Both are in .gitignore: keep secrets there, not in this file.
#
# APP_LOG=debug
# APP_DEVTOOLS=1
# APP_PG_URL=postgres://app:app@localhost:5433/app
